sequenceDiagram
  participant Candidate
  participant React as React Frontend
  participant FastAPI
  participant Auth as Authentication
  participant Camera as Camera Manager
  participant Evidence as Evidence Services
  participant CIE
  participant Agentic as Agentic Support
  participant IPIME
  participant Reviewer
  participant PostgreSQL
  Candidate->>React: Submit credentials
  React->>FastAPI: POST /auth/login
  FastAPI->>Auth: Validate credentials
  Auth->>PostgreSQL: Read user and roles
  PostgreSQL-->>Auth: User and role data
  Auth-->>FastAPI: Issue access/refresh tokens
  FastAPI-->>React: Authentication response
  Candidate->>React: Start examination
  React->>FastAPI: Create examination session
  FastAPI->>Camera: Initialise authorised devices
  Camera->>Evidence: Stream-health EvidenceEvent
  Evidence->>PostgreSQL: Persist raw EvidenceEvent
  Evidence->>CIE: Submit structured event
  opt Incident detected
    CIE->>Agentic: Contextual assessment
    Agentic->>IPIME: Advisory recommendation
    IPIME->>Reviewer: Policy response and notification
    Reviewer->>FastAPI: Record human action
    FastAPI->>PostgreSQL: Persist decision and audit trail
  end
